# SPA fallback, duplicated here on purpose.
#
# `assets.not_found_handling: "single-page-application"` in wrangler.jsonc
# already does this for the production deployment, but Cloudflare does not
# apply that setting to Preview deployments (measured: TOM-19), so a deep link
# into a branch preview 404s where production serves index.html.
#
# `_redirects` is uploaded with the Preview deployment, so the rule reaches
# both. It is a dynamic rule (it contains a splat), which Cloudflare evaluates
# only after static asset matching, so real files still win and production
# behaviour is unchanged.
/*  /index.html  200
